{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 4061694953469205042,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The Invertible Matrix Theorem",
      "source_hash": 1410881621155068779,
      "context_hash": 4744912762574409428,
      "translation": "가역행렬 정리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Invertible Matrix Theorem": "가역행렬 정리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109091Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "<em>Theorem:</em> the invertible matrix theorem.",
      "source_hash": 5435204387530365947,
      "context_hash": 5624170699654743657,
      "translation": "<em>정리:</em> 가역행렬 정리.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Invertible Matrix Theorem": "가역행렬 정리",
        "theorem": "정리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109092Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This section consists of a single important theorem containing many equivalent conditions for a matrix to be invertible.",
      "source_hash": 984383005131758261,
      "context_hash": 11593686694796814071,
      "translation": "이 절은 행렬이 가역이기 위한 여러 동치 조건을 담은 하나의 중요한 정리로 이루어져 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible": "가역",
        "matrix": "행렬",
        "theorem": "정리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109092Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "This is one of the most important theorems in this textbook.",
      "source_hash": 4473746804581206854,
      "context_hash": 9354462855028849980,
      "translation": "이 정리는 이 교재에서 가장 중요한 정리 중 하나입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "theorems": "정리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109092Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "We will append two more criteria in <xref ref=\"eigenvectors\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 9978138151750227082,
      "context_hash": 6562541253497675768,
      "translation": "<xref ref=\"eigenvectors\"/>에서 두 가지 판정 기준을 더 추가할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109093Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Invertible Matrix Theorem",
      "source_hash": 2033721893910232913,
      "context_hash": 1699858935803458100,
      "translation": "가역행렬 정리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Invertible Matrix Theorem": "가역행렬 정리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109093Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Let <m>A</m> be an <m>n\\times n</m> matrix, and let <m>T\\colon\\R^n\\to\\R^n</m> be the matrix transformation <m>T(x) = Ax</m>.",
      "source_hash": 13278594901838186803,
      "context_hash": 10672514047059390582,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>를 <m>n\\times n</m> 행렬이라 하고, <m>T\\colon\\R^n\\to\\R^n</m>를 행렬 변환 <m>T(x) = Ax</m>라 합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "matrix": "행렬",
        "matrix transformation": "행렬 변환"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109093Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "The following statements are equivalent:",
      "source_hash": 8549598017959027298,
      "context_hash": 17577504029620696032,
      "translation": "다음 명제들은 동치입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "The following statements are equivalent:": "다음 명제들은 동치입니다."
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109093Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>A</m> is invertible.",
      "source_hash": 6275802510331793483,
      "context_hash": 8539241735116818717,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>는 가역입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible": "가역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109093Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>A</m> has <m>n</m> pivots.",
      "source_hash": 17781298788580479697,
      "context_hash": 594057473968745807,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>는 <m>n</m>개의 피벗을 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pivots": "피벗"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109093Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The columns of <m>A</m> are linearly independent.",
      "source_hash": 954442190548334082,
      "context_hash": 1120622098234571030,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>의 열들은 일차독립입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "columns": "열",
        "linearly independent": "일차독립"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109093Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The columns of <m>A</m> span <m>\\R^n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 17087735844919583538,
      "context_hash": 661373795332204427,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>의 열들은 <m>\\R^n</m>을 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "columns": "열",
        "span": "생성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109094Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>Ax=b</m> has a unique solution for each <m>b</m> in <m>\\R^n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 2183233725808442840,
      "context_hash": 10151617835946385058,
      "translation": "<m>\\R^n</m>의 각 <m>b</m>에 대해 <m>Ax=b</m>는 유일한 해를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "unique solution": "유일한 해"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109094Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>T</m> is invertible.",
      "source_hash": 16892666769915679237,
      "context_hash": 11696428713526483528,
      "translation": "<m>T</m>는 가역입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible": "가역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109094Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>T</m> is one-to-one.",
      "source_hash": 5690389945257644325,
      "context_hash": 16836784903185510760,
      "translation": "<m>T</m>는 일대일입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "one-to-one": "일대일"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109094Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>T</m> is onto.",
      "source_hash": 14964903661006769445,
      "context_hash": 1829173786089515108,
      "translation": "<m>T</m>는 전사입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109094Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>(1\\iff 2)</m>: The matrix <m>A</m> has <m>n</m> pivots if and only if its reduced row echelon form is the identity matrix <m>I_n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 14696710229368045580,
      "context_hash": 4967124877682918153,
      "translation": "<m>(1\\iff 2)</m>: 행렬 <m>A</m>가 <m>n</m>개의 피벗을 가질 필요충분조건은 그 기약 행 사다리꼴이 단위행렬 <m>I_n</m>인 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "identity matrix": "단위행렬",
        "matrix": "행렬",
        "pivots": "피벗",
        "reduced row echelon form": "기약 행 사다리꼴"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109094Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:13/seg:1",
      "source": "This happens exactly when the <xref ref=\"matrix-inv-how-to-compute\">procedure</xref> to compute the inverse succeeds.",
      "source_hash": 6829063317810857622,
      "context_hash": 2778565202934749043,
      "translation": "이는 역행렬을 계산하는 <xref ref=\"matrix-inv-how-to-compute\">절차</xref>가 성공할 때와 정확히 일치합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109095Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>(2\\iff 3)</m>:\n         The null space of a matrix is <m>\\{0\\}</m> if and only if the matrix has no free variables, which means that every column is a pivot column, which means <m>A</m> has <m>n</m> pivots.",
      "source_hash": 14233324462725706697,
      "context_hash": 15907191513846387462,
      "translation": "<m>(2\\iff 3)</m>: 행렬의 영공간이 <m>\\{0\\}</m>일 필요충분조건은 그 행렬에 자유변수가 없는 것이며, 이는 모든 열이 피벗 열이라는 뜻이고, 이는 곧 <m>A</m>가 <m>n</m>개의 피벗을 가진다는 뜻입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "column": "열",
        "free variables": "자유변수",
        "matrix": "행렬",
        "null space": "영공간",
        "pivot column": "피벗 열",
        "pivots": "피벗"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109095Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:14/seg:1",
      "source": "See this <xref ref=\"subspaces-span-nullspace\">recipe</xref>.",
      "source_hash": 15921735721390814857,
      "context_hash": 2696789851733722170,
      "translation": "이 <xref ref=\"subspaces-span-nullspace\">계산 절차</xref>를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Recipe": "계산 절차"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109095Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>(2\\iff 4,\\,2\\iff 5)</m>:\n         These follow from this <xref ref=\"linindep-matrix-cols\">recipe</xref> and this <xref ref=\"matrixeq-thm-full-span\"/>, respectively, since <m>A</m> has <m>n</m> pivots if and only if has a pivot in every row/column.",
      "source_hash": 14557464122574451527,
      "context_hash": 10900377173502084700,
      "translation": "<m>(2\\iff 4,\\,2\\iff 5)</m>: <m>A</m>가 <m>n</m>개의 피벗을 가질 필요충분조건은 모든 행/열에 피벗이 있는 것이므로, 이들은 각각 이 <xref ref=\"linindep-matrix-cols\">계산 절차</xref>와 이 <xref ref=\"matrixeq-thm-full-span\"/>에서 따라 나옵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Recipe": "계산 절차",
        "column": "열",
        "pivot": "피벗",
        "pivots": "피벗",
        "row": "행"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109095Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>(4+5\\iff 6)</m>:\n         We know <m>Ax=b</m> has at least one solution for every <m>b</m> if and only if the columns of <m>A</m> span <m>\\R^n</m> by this <xref ref=\"matrix-trans-onto\"/>, and <m>Ax=b</m> has at most one solution for every <m>b</m> if and only if the columns of <m>A</m> are linearly independent by this <xref ref=\"matrix-trans-one-to-one\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 2957483479304204464,
      "context_hash": 16143192963206995951,
      "translation": "<m>(4+5\\iff 6)</m>: 이 <xref ref=\"matrix-trans-onto\"/>에 의해 모든 <m>b</m>에 대해 <m>Ax=b</m>가 적어도 하나의 해를 가질 필요충분조건은 <m>A</m>의 열들이 <m>\\R^n</m>을 생성하는 것이고, 이 <xref ref=\"matrix-trans-one-to-one\"/>에 의해 모든 <m>b</m>에 대해 <m>Ax=b</m>가 많아야 하나의 해를 가질 필요충분조건은 <m>A</m>의 열들이 일차독립인 것임을 알고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "columns": "열",
        "linearly independent": "일차독립",
        "span": "생성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:16/seg:1",
      "source": "Hence <m>Ax=b</m> has exactly one solution for every <m>b</m> if and only if its columns are linearly independent and span <m>\\R^n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 517942054852965906,
      "context_hash": 6291837845678584413,
      "translation": "따라서 모든 <m>b</m>에 대해 <m>Ax=b</m>가 정확히 하나의 해를 가질 필요충분조건은 그 열들이 일차독립이면서 <m>\\R^n</m>을 생성하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "columns": "열",
        "linearly independent": "일차독립",
        "span": "생성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>(1\\iff 7)</m>:\n         This is the content of this <xref ref=\"matrix-inv-matrix-inv-comp\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 9835847868274061704,
      "context_hash": 11494814944586980039,
      "translation": "<m>(1\\iff 7)</m>: 이것은 이 <xref ref=\"matrix-inv-matrix-inv-comp\"/>의 내용입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>(7\\implies 8+9)</m>:\n         See this <xref ref=\"matrix-inv-11-onto\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 8932240461071254683,
      "context_hash": 2368250411286658069,
      "translation": "<m>(7\\implies 8+9)</m>: 이 <xref ref=\"matrix-inv-11-onto\"/>에서 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>(8\\iff 4,\\,9\\iff 5)</m>:\n         See this this <xref ref=\"matrix-trans-one-to-one\"/> and this <xref ref=\"matrix-trans-onto\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 18419632887608362020,
      "context_hash": 8459105515053219804,
      "translation": "<m>(8\\iff 4,\\,9\\iff 5)</m>: 이 <xref ref=\"matrix-trans-one-to-one\"/>와 이 <xref ref=\"matrix-trans-onto\"/>에서 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "To reiterate, the invertible matrix theorem means:",
      "source_hash": 6063833749131472046,
      "context_hash": 2247294912792991109,
      "translation": "다시 정리하면, 가역행렬 정리가 의미하는 바는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Invertible Matrix Theorem": "가역행렬 정리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "There are two kinds of <em>square</em> matrices:",
      "source_hash": 6549632634381358116,
      "context_hash": 4547962013729221166,
      "translation": "<em>정사각</em> 행렬에는 두 종류가 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "matrices": "행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:22.109096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "invertible matrices, and",
      "source_hash": 1293112739964866412,
      "context_hash": 8236435546276638330,
      "translation": "가역 행렬, 그리고",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible matrices": "가역 행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:38:40.397481Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "non-invertible matrices.",
      "source_hash": 8563674794420801856,
      "context_hash": 1393395293047626471,
      "translation": "비가역 행렬.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible matrices": "가역 행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:38:40.397485Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:24/seg:0",
      "source": "For invertible matrices, all of the statements of the invertible matrix theorem are true.",
      "source_hash": 2544740702919535128,
      "context_hash": 4277884037560716265,
      "translation": "가역 행렬에 대해서는 가역행렬 정리의 모든 명제가 참입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Invertible Matrix Theorem": "가역행렬 정리",
        "invertible matrices": "가역 행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:38:40.397486Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "For non-invertible matrices, all of the statements of the invertible matrix theorem are false.",
      "source_hash": 2165372387215166128,
      "context_hash": 6695923287612331148,
      "translation": "비가역 행렬에 대해서는 가역행렬 정리의 모든 명제가 거짓입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Invertible Matrix Theorem": "가역행렬 정리",
        "invertible matrices": "가역 행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:38:40.397487Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "The reader should be comfortable translating any of the statements in the invertible matrix theorem into a statement about the pivots of a matrix.",
      "source_hash": 3601770274839655576,
      "context_hash": 11559491811579695520,
      "translation": "독자는 가역행렬 정리의 어떤 명제든 행렬의 피벗에 관한 명제로 바꾸어 말하는 데 익숙해져야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Invertible Matrix Theorem": "가역행렬 정리",
        "matrix": "행렬",
        "pivots": "피벗"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283841Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Other Conditions for Invertibility",
      "source_hash": 11993215921798538038,
      "context_hash": 18195160281580780051,
      "translation": "가역성에 대한 그 밖의 조건",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertibility": "가역성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283842Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The following conditions are also equivalent to the invertibility of a square matrix <m>A</m>.",
      "source_hash": 7632043297605052836,
      "context_hash": 13841631979490049218,
      "translation": "다음 조건들도 정사각행렬 <m>A</m>의 가역성과 동치입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertibility": "가역성",
        "square matrix": "정사각행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283843Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "They are all simple restatements of conditions in the invertible matrix theorem.",
      "source_hash": 4586533429809456344,
      "context_hash": 7671080175696487762,
      "translation": "이들은 모두 가역행렬 정리에 나오는 조건들을 간단히 바꾸어 말한 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Invertible Matrix Theorem": "가역행렬 정리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283843Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The reduced row echelon form of <m>A</m> is the identity matrix <m>I_n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 5661643880873629978,
      "context_hash": 17688137888503565051,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>의 기약 행 사다리꼴은 단위행렬 <m>I_n</m>입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "identity matrix": "단위행렬",
        "reduced row echelon form": "기약 행 사다리꼴"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283844Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>Ax=0</m> has no solutions other than the trivial one.",
      "source_hash": 792718101881073107,
      "context_hash": 7917955587604554841,
      "translation": "<m>Ax=0</m>은 자명해 이외의 해를 갖지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283844Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The columns of <m>A</m> form a basis for <m>\\R^n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 17312676622719083818,
      "context_hash": 18031119234874589050,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>의 열들은 <m>\\R^n</m>의 기저를 이룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "basis": "기저",
        "columns": "열"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283845Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "<m>Ax=b</m> is consistent for all <m>b</m> in <m>\\R^n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 693331715061155652,
      "context_hash": 9883056384367626358,
      "translation": "<m>\\R^n</m>의 모든 <m>b</m>에 대해 <m>Ax=b</m>는 해를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283845Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Now we can show that to check <m>B = A\\inv</m>, it's enough to show <m>AB=I_n</m> <em>or</em> <m>BA=I_n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 8902959477050769097,
      "context_hash": 16304621732519170781,
      "translation": "이제 <m>B = A\\inv</m>임을 확인하려면 <m>AB=I_n</m> <em>또는</em> <m>BA=I_n</m>임을 보이는 것으로 충분하다는 사실을 보일 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283845Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "A Left or Right Inverse Suffices",
      "source_hash": 13205116471919685965,
      "context_hash": 7427367117288814827,
      "translation": "왼쪽 역행렬이나 오른쪽 역행렬 하나로 충분합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283845Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Let <m>A</m> be an <m>n\\times n</m> matrix, and suppose that there exists an <m>n\\times n</m> matrix <m>B</m> such that <m>AB=I_n</m> <em>or</em> <m>BA=I_n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 9792027744034400518,
      "context_hash": 17904210288484099787,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>를 <m>n\\times n</m> 행렬이라 하고, <m>AB=I_n</m> <em>또는</em> <m>BA=I_n</m>을 만족하는 <m>n\\times n</m> 행렬 <m>B</m>가 존재한다고 가정합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "matrix": "행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283846Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Then <m>A</m> is invertible and <m>B = A\\inv</m>.",
      "source_hash": 7346430868496065092,
      "context_hash": 12682006063973822350,
      "translation": "그러면 <m>A</m>는 가역이고 <m>B = A\\inv</m>입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible": "가역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283846Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Suppose that <m>AB = I_n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 9269476762027177015,
      "context_hash": 6060921309842595240,
      "translation": "<m>AB = I_n</m>이라고 가정합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283846Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "We claim that <m>T(x)=Ax</m> is onto.",
      "source_hash": 7664668428010470044,
      "context_hash": 8823232952860254156,
      "translation": "<m>T(x)=Ax</m>가 전사임을 보이겠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283846Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Indeed, for any <m>b</m> in <m>\\R^n</m>, we have\n         <me>\n           b = I_nb = (AB)b = A(Bb),\n         </me>\n         so <m>T(Bb) = b</m>, and hence <m>b</m> is in the range of <m>T</m>.",
      "source_hash": 11819298274422125169,
      "context_hash": 71959351779153492,
      "translation": "실제로 <m>\\R^n</m>의 임의의 <m>b</m>에 대해 <me>\n           b = I_nb = (AB)b = A(Bb),\n         </me>이므로 <m>T(Bb) = b</m>이고, 따라서 <m>b</m>는 <m>T</m>의 치역에 속합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "range": "치역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283846Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "Therefore, <m>A</m> is invertible by the <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 11098742414660121023,
      "context_hash": 1370655318917015512,
      "translation": "그러므로 <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>에 의해 <m>A</m>는 가역입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible": "가역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283846Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:4",
      "source": "Since <m>A</m> is invertible, we have\n         <me>\n           A\\inv = A\\inv I_n = A\\inv (AB) = (A\\inv A)B = I_n B = B,\n         </me>\n         so <m>B = A\\inv.</m>",
      "source_hash": 15828047229011471352,
      "context_hash": 4536478923676123072,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>가 가역이므로 <me>\n           A\\inv = A\\inv I_n = A\\inv (AB) = (A\\inv A)B = I_n B = B,\n         </me>이고, 따라서 <m>B = A\\inv.</m>입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible": "가역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283847Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Now suppose that <m>BA = I_n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 15631404714848325948,
      "context_hash": 14059070412198916144,
      "translation": "이제 <m>BA = I_n</m>이라고 가정합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283847Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "We claim that <m>T(x) = Ax</m> is one-to-one.",
      "source_hash": 10078487651487091135,
      "context_hash": 988836435527664457,
      "translation": "<m>T(x) = Ax</m>가 일대일임을 보이겠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "one-to-one": "일대일"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283847Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Indeed, suppose that <m>T(x) = T(y)</m>.",
      "source_hash": 16683830523670802831,
      "context_hash": 15679485947043948225,
      "translation": "실제로 <m>T(x) = T(y)</m>라고 가정합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283847Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "Then <m>Ax = Ay</m>, so <m>BAx = BAy</m>.",
      "source_hash": 7591155132403473260,
      "context_hash": 8798913269173507625,
      "translation": "그러면 <m>Ax = Ay</m>이므로 <m>BAx = BAy</m>입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283847Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:4",
      "source": "But <m>BA = I_n</m>, so <m>I_nx = I_ny</m>, and hence <m>x=y</m>.",
      "source_hash": 4550231198460132975,
      "context_hash": 15262990485716640809,
      "translation": "그런데 <m>BA = I_n</m>이므로 <m>I_nx = I_ny</m>이고, 따라서 <m>x=y</m>입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283848Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:5",
      "source": "Therefore, <m>A</m> is invertible by the <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 11098742414660121023,
      "context_hash": 8535130756733361516,
      "translation": "그러므로 <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>에 의해 <m>A</m>는 가역입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible": "가역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283848Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:6",
      "source": "One shows that <m>B = A\\inv</m> as above.",
      "source_hash": 7429045877246211703,
      "context_hash": 16813848621458035093,
      "translation": "<m>B = A\\inv</m>임은 위와 같이 보일 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283848Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "We conclude with some common situations in which the invertible matrix theorem is useful.",
      "source_hash": 7142812202738434356,
      "context_hash": 536692471221097149,
      "translation": "끝으로 가역행렬 정리가 유용하게 쓰이는 몇 가지 흔한 상황을 살펴보겠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Invertible Matrix Theorem": "가역행렬 정리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283848Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Is this matrix invertible?\n         <me>A = \\mat{1 2 -1; 2 4 7; -2 -4 1}</me>",
      "source_hash": 12058969783199079531,
      "context_hash": 6645238594304877189,
      "translation": "이 행렬은 가역입니까? <me>A = \\mat{1 2 -1; 2 4 7; -2 -4 1}</me>",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible": "가역",
        "matrix": "행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The second column is a multiple of the first.",
      "source_hash": 146755356810735045,
      "context_hash": 5528201398427279738,
      "translation": "둘째 열은 첫째 열의 상수배입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "column": "열"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "The columns are linearly dependent, so <m>A</m> does not satisfy condition 4 of the <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 280234252250553620,
      "context_hash": 12676076826737706366,
      "translation": "열들이 일차종속이므로 <m>A</m>는 <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>의 조건 4를 만족하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "columns": "열",
        "linearly dependent": "일차종속"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:2",
      "source": "Therefore, <m>A</m> is not invertible.",
      "source_hash": 8275740652288594364,
      "context_hash": 1684789791932216327,
      "translation": "그러므로 <m>A</m>는 가역이 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "invertible": "가역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Let <m>A</m> be an <m>n\\times n</m> matrix and let <m>T(x) = Ax</m>.",
      "source_hash": 9690449456334966739,
      "context_hash": 10094670259720893421,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>를 <m>n\\times n</m> 행렬이라 하고 <m>T(x) = Ax</m>라고 합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "matrix": "행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Suppose that the range of <m>T</m> is <m>\\R^n</m>.",
      "source_hash": 1959889872494137287,
      "context_hash": 2003367840056588032,
      "translation": "<m>T</m>의 치역이 <m>\\R^n</m>이라고 가정합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "range": "치역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:2",
      "source": "Show that the columns of <m>A</m> are linearly independent.",
      "source_hash": 5504352639888852022,
      "context_hash": 7442923299001955231,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>의 열들이 일차독립임을 보이십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "columns": "열",
        "linearly independent": "일차독립"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:22:19.283849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The range of <m>T</m> is the column space of <m>A</m>, so <m>A</m> satisfies condition 5 of the <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 13749414362127773287,
      "context_hash": 15132192331624239853,
      "translation": "<m>T</m>의 치역은 <m>A</m>의 열공간이므로, <m>A</m>는 <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>의 조건 5를 만족합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "column space": "열공간",
        "range": "치역"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979046Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Therefore, <m>A</m> also satisfies condition 4, which says that the columns of <m>A</m> are linearly independent.",
      "source_hash": 4593573673309708885,
      "context_hash": 5296979573400931860,
      "translation": "따라서 <m>A</m>는 조건 4도 만족하며, 이 조건은 <m>A</m>의 열들이 일차독립이라는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "columns": "열",
        "linearly independent": "일차독립"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979048Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Let <m>A</m> be a <m>3\\times 3</m> matrix such that\n         <me>A\\vec{1 7 0} = A\\vec{2 0 -1}.</me>",
      "source_hash": 12334742126233730846,
      "context_hash": 10634191277706618131,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>가 다음을 만족하는 <m>3\\times 3</m> 행렬이라고 합시다. <me>A\\vec{1 7 0} = A\\vec{2 0 -1}.</me>",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "matrix": "행렬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979048Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "Show that the rank of <m>A</m> is at most <m>2</m>.",
      "source_hash": 10409649197936928351,
      "context_hash": 1050675422838350547,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>의 랭크가 최대 <m>2</m>임을 보이십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "rank": "랭크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "If we set\n         <me>b = A\\vec{1 7 0} = A\\vec{2 0 -1},</me>\n         then <m>Ax=b</m> has multiple solutions, so it does not satisfy condition 6 of the <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 2281214547724601605,
      "context_hash": 14239437854944891857,
      "translation": "<me>b = A\\vec{1 7 0} = A\\vec{2 0 -1},</me>로 놓으면 <m>Ax=b</m>는 여러 개의 해를 가지므로, <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>의 조건 6을 만족하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "Therefore, it does not satisfy condition 5, so the columns of <m>A</m> do not span <m>\\R^3</m>.",
      "source_hash": 10479289467034418005,
      "context_hash": 12004375433782597858,
      "translation": "따라서 조건 5를 만족하지 않으므로, <m>A</m>의 열들은 <m>\\R^3</m>을 생성하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "columns": "열",
        "span": "생성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:2",
      "source": "Therefore, the column space has dimension strictly less than 3, the rank is at most <m>2</m>.",
      "source_hash": 6567597256141876624,
      "context_hash": 16904437811603128411,
      "translation": "따라서 열공간의 차원은 3보다 엄격히 작으므로, 랭크는 최대 <m>2</m>입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "column space": "열공간",
        "dimension": "차원",
        "rank": "랭크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Suppose that <m>A</m> is an <m>n\\times n</m> matrix such that <m>Ax=b</m> is inconsistent some vector <m>b</m>.",
      "source_hash": 8312537413792851385,
      "context_hash": 12330326346574160239,
      "translation": "<m>A</m>가 어떤 벡터 <m>b</m>에 대해 <m>Ax=b</m>가 해를 갖지 않는 <m>n\\times n</m> 행렬이라고 가정합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "matrix": "행렬",
        "vector": "벡터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "Show that <m>Ax=b</m> has infinitely many solutions for some (other) vector <m>b</m>.",
      "source_hash": 14053762760190275178,
      "context_hash": 5354632907728601121,
      "translation": "어떤 (다른) 벡터 <m>b</m>에 대해 <m>Ax=b</m>가 무수히 많은 해를 가짐을 보이십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "infinitely many solutions": "무수히 많은 해",
        "vector": "벡터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "By hypothesis, <m>A</m> does not satisfy condition 6 of the <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 7287784454405906160,
      "context_hash": 16702957801311101493,
      "translation": "가정에 의해 <m>A</m>는 <xref ref=\"imt-1\"/>의 조건 6을 만족하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "Therefore, it does not satisfy condition <m>3</m>, so <m>\\Nul(A)</m> is an infinite set.",
      "source_hash": 16291499892931339834,
      "context_hash": 10731544606171541663,
      "translation": "따라서 조건 <m>3</m>도 만족하지 않으므로, <m>\\Nul(A)</m>는 무한집합입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:17:04.979051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:2",
      "source": "If we take <m>b=0</m>, then the equation <m>Ax=b</m> has infinitely many solutions.",
      "source_hash": 5623064497667349644,
      "context_hash": 9559261864984675100,
      "translation": "<m>b=0</m>으로 잡으면 방정식 <m>Ax=b</m>는 무수히 많은 해를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
